#: foodle-for-democracy-poll.php:1672
msgid ""
"The Foodle shortcode is used to display the poll results in various ways. It "
"can be used on the same page as the democracy poll shortcode and will be "
"have interactively (AJAX) when voting. However, it can as well be used "
"independently on any page or post.</p>\n"
